# Rendered listening audio — 411 MB of WAV, DELIBERATELY not committed.
#
# It is fully regenerable and deterministic: the transcripts in src/data/items and
# scripts/items/synth-listening.py together decide every sample. Putting 411 MB of binary
# into history would be permanent, unreviewable in a diff, and would make every future
# clone carry it. Nothing is lost by leaving it out — but the files on disk are the only
# copy, so DO NOT `git clean -fdx` this working tree without re-rendering afterwards:
#   python scripts/items/synth-listening.py
#   python scripts/items/verify-listening-audio.py
public/audio/ch/
